the importance of human connection, KEB Group incorporates social spaces that encourage interaction. Open-plan layouts within residential buildings create opportunities for shared experiences and foster a sense of community.\n  * Opti-Work-Life: In response to the rise of remote work, the company has included flexible workspaces in its developments. These spaces cater to the Small-office-Home-office (SoHo) lifestyle, enabling residents to easily balance work and personal life.\n\n### The Netizen: A testament to resilience and innovation\n\nThe Netizen project, located in Taman Cheras Perdana, exemplifies the Opti-Living philosophy in action. This freehold, mixed-use development, featuring 536 SoHo units and 660 serviced apartments, offers excellent connectivity to major highways and is just 200m from the MRT Tun Hussien Onn station. With a variety of nearby amenities, including hospitals and educational institutions, The Netizen provides residents with the convenience of urban living in a well-connected neighbourhood. --------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nThe Netizen, Bandar Tun Hussein Onn - Property Info, Photos & Statistics | iRumah (https://irumah.co/bandar-tun-hussein-onn/the-netizen)\nciteturn286search8 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; # The Netizen, Bandar Tun Hussein Onn ... There are 660 condominium units and 536 SOHO units available at this property with built-up from 546 sf to 1,328 sf for condominium units and 547 sf for SOHO units. ... KEB Group is a mid-sized real estate group, and it has undertaken around 5 real estate projects in Malaysia.\n\n# The Netizen, Bandar Tun Hussein Onn\n\nThe Netizen is a freehold integrated mall, office & residential hub that is located in Bandar Tun Hussein Onn, Cheras South. There are 660 condominium units and 536 SOHO units available at this property with built-up from 546 sf to 1,328 sf for condominium units and 547 sf for SOHO units. It was developed by KEB Group with a launch price of around RM450 psf for condominium units, RM490 psf for SOHO units, and was completed in about 2020.\n\nKEB Group is a mid-sized real estate group, and it has undertaken around 5 real estate projects in Malaysia. Other similar projects by the same developer are Cove Residence, Dezire Hill, Residensi Bukit Palma and Residensi Bukit Palma 2.\n\nProperty Type\n\nIntegrated Mall, Office & Residential\n\nTenure\n\nFreehold\n\nBuilt-up\n\n546 sf - 1,328 sf (Condominium)\n\n547 sf (SOHO)\n\nMarket Price\n\nRM330,000 - RM660,000 (Condominium)\n\nRM330,000 (SOHO)\n\nTotal Units\n\n660 Condominiums & 536 SOHOs\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nContact | ARCHIMATRIX Architects Malaysia (https://www.archimatrix.com.my/contact)\nciteturn286search9 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 3 weeks ago; 58100 Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia. ... general@archimatrix.com.my\n\n# Contact\n\nARCHIMATRIX SDN BHD\n9-1-10, Jalan 3/109F,\nDanau Business Centre,\nTaman Danau Desa,\n58100 Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia.\n\n+603 7984 3121\ngeneral@archimatrix.com.my\n\nWAZE | Google Maps\n\n#### Join us\n\nARCHIMATRIX is a young, dynamic and creative studio office. We are always keen to hear from, and to meet with, exceptional candidates with strong design, job-running, and / or project management skill. All enquiries can be sent to hr@archimatrix.com.my or submit via Jobstreet application.\n\nARCHIMATRIX is an equal opportunity employer.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nThe Netizen, Bandar Tun Hussein Onn - Maklumat Hartanah, Gambar & Statistik | iRumah (https://irumah.co/bm/bandar-tun-hussein-onn/the-netizen)\nciteturn286search10 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; # The Netizen, Bandar Tun Hussein Onn ... Ada 660 unit kondominium dan 536 unit SOHO tersedia pada hartanah ini dengan binaan dari 546 sf hingga 1,328 sf untuk unit kondominium dan 547 sf untuk unit SOHO. ... KEB Group ialah sebuah kumpulan hartanah bersaiz sederhana, dan ia telah menjalankan sekitar 5 projek hartanah di Malaysia.\n\n# The Netizen, Bandar Tun Hussein Onn\n\nThe Netizen ialah sebuah hab mall, pejabat & kediaman bersepadu pegangan bebas yang terletak di Bandar Tun Hussein Onn, Cheras South. Ada 660 unit kondominium dan 536 unit SOHO tersedia pada hartanah ini dengan binaan dari 546 sf hingga 1,328 sf untuk unit kondominium dan 547 sf untuk unit SOHO. Ia dibangunkan oleh KEB Group dengan harga pelancaran sekitar RM450 psf untuk unit kondominium, RM490 psf untuk unit SOHO, dan telah siap lebih kurang 2020.\n\nKEB Group ialah sebuah kumpulan hartanah bersaiz sederhana, dan ia telah menjalankan sekitar 5 projek hartanah di Malaysia. Projek serupa lain oleh pemaju yang sama ialah Cove Residence, Dezire Hill, Residensi Bukit Palma dan Residensi Bukit Palma 2.\n\nJenis Hartanah\n\nMall, Pejabat & Kediaman Bersepadu\n\nPegangan\n\nPegangan Bebas\n\nBinaan\n\n546 sf - 1,328 sf (Kondominium)\n\n547 sf (SOHO)\n\nHarga Pasaran\n\nRM330,000 - RM660,000 (Kondominium)\n\nRM330,000 (SOHO)\n\nJumlah Unit\n\n660 Kondominium & 536 SOHO\n\nTarikh Siap\n\n2020\n\nPemaju\n\nKEB Group\n\nHarga Pelancaran\n\nRM450 psf (Kondominium)\n\nRM490 psf (SOHO)\n\nHab mall, pejabat & kediaman bersepadu ini mempunyai beberapa kemudahan berdekatan, seperti, sekolah dan stesen transit. Berikut adalah beberapa stesen transit utama di sini:\n\n  * MRT Bandar Tun Hussein Onn\n  * MRT Batu 11 Cheras\n\nHasil sewaan semasa The Netizen ialah 5.54% untuk unit kondominium dan 5.23% untuk unit SOHO. Hasil sewaan tertinggi pernah direkodkan ialah 5.54% pada 2025 (kondominium) dan 5.49% pada 2023 (soho); manakala yang paling rendah ialah 4.94% pada 2023 (kondominium) dan 5.23% pada 2024 (soho). Sementara itu, layout dan saiz unit yang paling biasa tersedia di sini adalah seperti berikut:\n\nLayout Kondominium\n\nGabungan layout dan saiz (binaan) yang paling popular di The Netizen untuk unit kondominium ialah 3-bedroom / 969 sf dengan harga median terkini RM500 psf. Dari segi harga, yang paling mahal ialah 1-bedroom / 547 sf dengan harga median terkini RM600 psf; manakala yang paling murah ialah 3-bedroom / 969 sf dengan harga median terkini RM500 psf.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nService Residence for Sale in The Netizen by TERRY LEONG (https://www.iproperty.com.my/property/cheras/the-netizen/sale-104874915/)\nciteturn286search11 [wordlim: 200] Published: last month; Crawled: today; The development, spanning a substantial site area, is architecturally distinguished and is expected to rise to approximately 38 storeys.The design harmoniously blends urban elegance with natural features, showcasing sleek and modern architectural elements.Project Name: The NetizenType: Service ResidenceDistrict: Bandar Tun Hussein OnnConfiguration: The Netizen comprises 1,196 residential units across two towers, each 38 floors high and connected by a sky bridge, featuring 536 SoHo units and 660 apartment residences.Unit Types: Offers SOHO units and apartments with one- and two-bedroom layouts, ranging from 547 sq ft to 1,328 sq ft, suited for various lifestyle preferences.About the DeveloperDesigned by KEB Group, which is not only one of the oldest property developers in town but also well-established in Cheras, Kajang, and Semenyih, The Netizen boasts an excellent standard.\n## The Netizen, Bandar Tun Hussein Onn, Cheras\n\nThe NetizenThe Netizen is a prestigious serviced residence located at Jalan Residence 2, Bandar Mahkota Cheras, 43200 Cheras, Selangor, within the vibrant township of Bandar Tun Hussein Onn. Developed by KEB Group, this freehold project comprises 1,196 units, including 536 SOHO (Small Office Home Office) units and 660 apartment units, spread across two towers that rise 38 floors each and are connected by a sky bridge.The Netizen is thoughtfully designed to suit a wide range of lifestyle needs. The flexible-use SOHO units can function as either residential or office spaces, making them ideal for young professionals, small business owners, or investors seeking versatility.The project, completed in 2022, amalgamates residential, commercial, and office spaces. Some standard facilities include a basement car park, indoor sports courts, and recreational areas.Why The Netizen Stands Out: Key Lifestyle AdvantagesThe Netizen offers an excellent location in Cheras, providing residents with convenient access to Kuala Lumpur City Centre. Residents enjoy quick access to several MRT stations, includingBandar Tun Hussein Onn MRT Station (KG29)Batu Sebelas Cheras MRT Station (KG30)Sri Raya MRT Station (KG31)Bukit Dukung MRT Station (KG32)Taman Suntex MRT station (KG27)Features seamless connectivity to major expressways, including the Cheras-Kajang Expressway, ensuring smooth commutes to key destinations such as Kuala Lumpur City Centre.The vibrant neighbourhood around Bandar Mahkota Cheras adds to its appeal, with parks and green spaces nearby, providing a balanced urban environment.Smartly Designed Spaces & Modern FacilitiesA netizen is a complete community in itself, housing every kind of luxurious facility that meets the diverse requirements of its lifestyle, offering a comprehensive environment for living.Have a dedicated barbecue area perfect for social gatherings, family events, and outdoor dining experiences.Privately fenced boundaries provide residents with complete security from unauthorised entry and enhance the property's value.A 24-hour surveillance system that continuously monitors the area provides a safe and worry-free environment.Amenities are designed to provide a space for relaxation, fitness, and interaction with other residents, creating a peaceful and modern environment for living amidst nature.Schools Just Minutes AwayFamilies residing in The Netizen benefit from proximity to several educational institutions, including:SRK Bandar Tun Hussein OnnSK Bandar Tun Hussein OnnSMK Bandar Tun Hussein OnnFlavours Around You: Dining Near The NetizenThe Netizen is surrounded by a diverse range of culinary delights, including:117 Coffee DineWarong KaklongWarung SimpleHealthcare Within Reach: Clinics & Medical Centres NearbyResidents have access to various medical facilities, such as:Klinik EzzeKlinik Mediviron Bandar Tun Hussein OnnKlinik Anda 24 JamEveryday Essentials: Supermarkets Close to HomeConvenience is further enhanced with supermarkets nearby, including:Giant HypermarketEconsaveThe StoreThe Netizen MasterplanThe Netizen is situated at Jalan Residence 2, Bandar Mahkota Cheras, Cheras. The development, spanning a substantial site area, is architecturally distinguished and is expected to rise to approximately 38 storeys.The design harmoniously blends urban elegance with natural features, showcasing sleek and modern architectural elements.Project Name: The NetizenType: Service ResidenceDistrict: Bandar Tun Hussein OnnConfiguration: The Netizen comprises 1,196 residential units across two towers, each 38 floors high and connected by a sky bridge, featuring 536 SoHo units and 660 apartment residences.Unit Types: Offers SOHO units and apartments with one- and two-bedroom layouts, ranging from 547 sq ft to 1,328 sq ft, suited for various lifestyle preferences.About the DeveloperDesigned by KEB Group, which is not only one of the oldest property developers in town but also well-established in Cheras, Kajang, and Semenyih, The Netizen boasts an excellent standard. KEB Group has undoubtedly established a commendable reputation as an integrator of high-quality residential and commercial projects that meet modern market demand.Revered for its developments in the upscale category, KEB Group therefore assures thoughtful design, durability in construction, and contemporary aesthetics for every project. The Netizen is no exception, offering high-quality living through its upscale construction, along with a guarantee of functionality from the developer.This development aligns with KEB Group's vision of creating well-integrated, high-value communities. The mixture of modern architecture, practical layouts, and premium amenities serves to reinforce The Netizen's identity as a coveted residence, perfectly in keeping with what the informed urban homeowner expects.Related ProjectsDiscover other developments by KEB Group that reflect the same commitment to innovation.Residensi Kesuma 1Neighbourhood Highlights: Other Developments Around The NetizenThe Netizen is situated in a neighbourhood that includes several other prominent residential developments, contributing to the vibrant community atmosphere. Nearby projects include:Cheras Perdana Ria ApartmentTaman Megah Cheras ApartmentCheras Perdana Apartment Block A, B, CThe Netizen stands out as an attractive opportunity for those seeking modern urban living in a prime Cheras location. Designed with a focus on convenience and lifestyle, it offers a comprehensive range of facilities, such as recreational spaces, security features, and integrated commercial elements to support everyday needs.With excellent connectivity to Kuala Lumpur City Centre, major expressways, and MRT stations, The Netizen ensures ease of access while maintaining a comfortable residential atmosphere. Its strategic location and well-planned design make it a solid choice for everyone looking to invest in a high-quality, future-ready living environment.\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nA9RCD57.tmp.pdf (https://myassets.theedgemalaysia.com/pdf/specialissues/Centurion-2025.pdf)\nciteturn286search12 [wordlim: 200] Published: 1.1 years ago; THE EDGE MALAYSIA | AUGUST 18, 2025 ... <tr><td>SUPERCOMNET TECHNOLOGIES BHD</td><td>HEALTHCARE</td><td>25.2</td><td>32.9</td><td>29</td><td>31.1</td><td>928.5</td></tr> ... <tr><td>SFP TECH HOLDINGS BHD</td><td>TECHNOLOGY</td><td>0</td><td>32</td><td>39.1</td><td>0</td><td>660</td></tr> ... <tr><td>CBH ENGINEERING HOLDING BHD</td><td>IND-PROD & SERVICES</td